Z||000025||Haze_Performance||07-08-2001||05:22 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrgone:<BR><B>haze, i not minutes ago printed off a pic of your car (85 sport coupe). i said, "this is the nice-ness i want to achieve." <P>is there a duke in that? <BR>and what mods didja do to it?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks mrgone,<BR>  It does have a Duke in it... The only mod the the engine has is the GT exhaust. I just turned 50,000. Since that pic I've added Crossdrilled Rotors, Stainless Lines, FOCOA Pontiac Style Side Scoops + some more little stuff. I've been thinking of doing away with the duke but it runs so well, I don't want to mess with it yet..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/classicfieroowners3.gif">         </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||10
